  "history": [],
  "facts": [
    "The M.E.C.H.A is a temporary troop that is available in the Anime Clash event. She is unlocked when 1,000 is obtained.",
    "The M.E.C.H.A is a defense-targeting troop with generally high hitpoints. She deals increased (20x) damage to Walls when attacking, although not preferentially targeting them. In this regard she is quite similar to a Super Giant, as both target defenses with increased damage to Walls.",
    "She is comparable to that of the P.E.K.K.A, as the M.E.C.H.A's attack and movement speed are much faster, and costs 10 housing space, meaning she is prone to Spring Traps. She also has much less hitpoints."
  ],
